<title>SINGAPORE: Sing Technologies sees improved 1997.</title>
<headline>Sing Technologies sees improved 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp (STIC) said on Monday it expected its results in 1997 to show an improvement over those for 1996.  </p>
<p>STIC made the forecast in a statement issued with its 1996 full year financial results.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>The company reported a 22 percent increase in net profit to Singapore $66.55 million for the year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
